MODULE: RepairAcknowledgesWithoutApplication
TARGET: NoSkipWithoutDeadLetter
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: repairing the cause itself advances the sender before actual application
PERTURBS: RepairDecided

--- FIND
    /\ decided \cap bad # {} /\ bad' = bad \ decided
    /\ UNCHANGED <<cursor, sent, queue, applied, parked, mode, age, space,
--- REPLACE
    /\ decided \cap bad # {} /\ bad' = bad \ decided /\ cursor' = Records
    /\ UNCHANGED <<sent, queue, applied, parked, mode, age, space,
--- END
